@startuml guest_class
title Increment 4 - Guest Records and History - Class Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Guest {
  +guestId: UUID
  +fullName: String
  +phone: String
  +email: String
  --
  +updateContactInfo()
}

class Reservation {
  +reservationId: UUID
  +bookingReference: String
  +checkInDate: Date
  +checkOutDate: Date
  +status: ReservationStatus
}

class Stay {
  +stayId: UUID
  +checkedInAt: DateTime
  +checkedOutAt: DateTime
}

class GuestManagementService <<service>> {
  +createGuest()
  +searchGuests()
  +viewGuest()
  +updateGuest()
  +recordMatchConfirmation()
  +linkReservation()
  +viewGuestHistory()
}

Guest "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : associated with
Reservation "1" -- "0..1" Stay : results in

GuestManagementService ..> Guest : manages
GuestManagementService ..> Reservation : links and reads
GuestManagementService ..> Stay : reads history

note right of Guest
  Guest record != login account.
  Contact fields and nullability
  will be decided in detailed design.
end note

note bottom of GuestManagementService
  The receptionist verifies a returning
  guest before a reservation is linked.
  No automatic record merging.
end note
@enduml
